e video to 0 and the recreation to build 0 in the same act · a Node check (in the harness) verifies the comparison file carries: both verbatim labels ×1 each, the anchor knots (4.5/6.5/8.5/10.5/12.5), the piecewise map function, segment.mp4 referenced exactly once (original side only), and the @media ≤560px stacking rule · phone stacking @media ≤560px; (4) own checks §5 legs 1–3 + A6 legs.
